{"id":"D01","split":"train","tool":"radio_link_diagnosis","question":"某 LTE 链路测得 SNR 8 dB、EVM 12%、BER 0.003、残余频偏 1800 Hz。按工具内置规则列出触发的劣化因素、证据和建议动作；给出下一步检查，不要求工具判断唯一排查优先级。","arguments":{"snr_db":8,"evm_percent":12,"ber":0.003,"frequency_offset_hz":1800},"answer_paths":["/status","/findings","/recommended_next_tool"],"source_ref":"repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md","kind":"tool_call","scenario_id":"curated_D01","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"status":"warning","finding_count":4,"findings":[{"cause":"noise_or_interference","severity":"warning","evidence":{"snr_gap_db":2.0},"actions":["降低 MCS","检查同频干扰与接收功率","增加测量样本后重新估计信道"]},{"cause":"carrier_frequency_offset","severity":"warning","evidence":{"normalized_offset":0.12},"actions":["执行 lte_frequency_sync","检查本振和多普勒补偿"]},{"cause":"poor_signal_quality","severity":"warning","evidence":{"evm_percent":12.0},"actions":["检查功放压缩、相噪和 IQ 失衡","运行 evm_metrics 并按层/子带定位"]},{"cause":"high_bit_error_rate","severity":"warning","evidence":{"ber":0.003},"actions":["降低 MCS","检查软解调、扰码和编码链"]}],"recommended_next_tool":"降低 MCS"}}
{"id":"D02","split":"selection","tool":"link_adaptation_optimizer","question":"LTE 下行链路 SNR 为 15 dB，可用 25 个 PRB，预留 2 dB 裕量，目标 BLER 为 0.1。按工具内置简化模型给出初步链路自适应建议和估算峰值吞吐。","arguments":{"snr_db":15,"nprb":25,"margin_db":2,"bler_target":0.1},"answer_paths":["/recommended_mcs","/modulation","/tbs_bits_per_subframe","/estimated_peak_mbps"],"source_ref":"repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md","kind":"tool_call","scenario_id":"curated_D02","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"recommended_mcs":15,"itbs":14,"modulation":"16QAM","rv":0,"tbs_bits_per_subframe":7224,"estimated_peak_mbps":7.224,"effective_snr_db":13.0,"margin_db":2.0,"bler_target":0.1,"method":"conservative_threshold_plus_3gpp_tables"}}
{"id":"D03","split":"holdout","tool":"resource_allocation_optimizer","question":"LTE 下行共有 25 个 PRB。u1 的 SNR 为 15 dB、需求 5000 kbps、优先级 2；u2 分别为 5 dB、2000 kbps、优先级 1。按工具的加权边际 TBS 策略试算各人 PRB 和需求是否满足；这是策略模拟，不是现场调度指令。","arguments":{"users":"[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"snr_db\":15,\"demand_kbps\":5000,\"priority\":2},{\"id\":\"u2\",\"snr_db\":5,\"demand_kbps\":2000,\"priority\":1}]","total_prbs":25},"answer_paths":["/allocations","/allocated_prbs"],"source_ref":"repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md","kind":"tool_call","scenario_id":"curated_D03","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"total_prbs":25,"allocated_prbs":25,"allocations":[{"id":"u1","allocated_prbs":24,"mcs":15,"modulation":"16QAM","tbs_bits_per_subframe":6968,"estimated_kbps":6968,"demand_kbps":5000.0,"demand_met":true},{"id":"u2","allocated_prbs":1,"mcs":6,"modulation":"QPSK","tbs_bits_per_subframe":328,"estimated_kbps":328,"demand_kbps":2000.0,"demand_met":false}],"method":"weighted_marginal_tbs"}}
{"id":"D04","split":"train","tool":"closed_loop_validator","question":"同口径测量下，一次外部调整前吞吐为 10 Mbps、BER 为 0.01、时延为 30 ms；调整后分别为 12 Mbps、0.001、25 ms。数值约束为 BER≤0.002、时延≤30 ms。仅做数值规则核验：是否通过、是否建议回滚？","arguments":{"before":"{\"throughput\":10,\"ber\":0.01,\"latency_ms\":30}","after":"{\"throughput\":12,\"ber\":0.001,\"latency_ms\":25}","constraints":"{\"ber\":{\"max\":0.002},\"latency_ms\":{\"max\":30}}"},"answer_paths":["/accepted","/rollback_recommended"],"source_ref":"repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md","kind":"tool_call","scenario_id":"curated_D04","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"accepted":true,"score":0.4222222222222223,"comparisons":{"ber":{"before":0.01,"after":0.001,"direction":"lower","improvement_fraction":0.9000000000000001,"result":"improved"},"latency_ms":{"before":30.0,"after":25.0,"direction":"lower","improvement_fraction":0.16666666666666666,"result":"improved"},"throughput":{"before":10.0,"after":12.0,"direction":"higher","improvement_fraction":0.2,"result":"improved"}},"constraint_violations":[],"rollback_recommended":false}}
