{"id":"A19","split":"train","kind":"tool_call","tool":"qos_policy_builder","question":"为一条保底 200 kbps、上限 500 kbps 的直播视频业务生成 5QI 导向的 QoS 初步建议；链路容量 1000 kbps、可承诺比例 0.8。给出建议和容量可行性。","arguments":{"services":"[{\"id\":\"live1\",\"service_type\":\"live_video\",\"guaranteed_kbps\":200,\"max_kbps\":500}]","link_capacity_kbps":1000,"reserve_fraction":0.8},"answer_paths":["/qos_data","/capacity_feasible"],"source_ref":"repo:tools/qos_policy_builder.schema.json","scenario_id":"curated_A19","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"qos_data":[{"service_id":"live1","service_type":"live_video","five_qi":2,"resource_type":"GBR","priority":5,"packet_delay_budget_ms":150.0,"packet_error_rate":0.001,"gfbr_kbps":200.0,"mfbr_kbps":500.0,"decision_basis":"service_template_with_explicit_overrides"}],"total_gfbr_kbps":200.0,"link_capacity_kbps":1000.0,"reserve_fraction":0.8,"capacity_feasible":true,"warning":null}}
{"id":"A20","split":"train","kind":"tool_call","tool":"resource_allocation_optimizer","question":"LTE 下行共有 18 个 PRB。三名用户的 (SNR dB,需求 kbps,优先级) 分别为 u1(18,3000,2)、u2(8,1500,1)、u3(3,500,1)。按工具的加权边际 TBS 策略试算分配，并列出每人的需求是否满足。","arguments":{"users":"[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"snr_db\":18,\"demand_kbps\":3000,\"priority\":2},{\"id\":\"u2\",\"snr_db\":8,\"demand_kbps\":1500,\"priority\":1},{\"id\":\"u3\",\"snr_db\":3,\"demand_kbps\":500,\"priority\":1}]","total_prbs":18},"answer_paths":["/allocations","/allocated_prbs"],"source_ref":"repo:tools/resource_allocation_optimizer.schema.json","scenario_id":"curated_A20","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"total_prbs":18,"allocated_prbs":18,"allocations":[{"id":"u1","allocated_prbs":9,"mcs":18,"modulation":"64QAM","tbs_bits_per_subframe":2984,"estimated_kbps":2984,"demand_kbps":3000.0,"demand_met":false},{"id":"u2","allocated_prbs":6,"mcs":8,"modulation":"QPSK","tbs_bits_per_subframe":808,"estimated_kbps":808,"demand_kbps":1500.0,"demand_met":false},{"id":"u3","allocated_prbs":3,"mcs":4,"modulation":"QPSK","tbs_bits_per_subframe":208,"estimated_kbps":208,"demand_kbps":500.0,"demand_met":false}],"method":"weighted_marginal_tbs"}}
{"id":"A21","split":"selection","kind":"tool_call","tool":"closed_loop_validator","question":"一次外部调整的同口径测量：吞吐由 5.0 到 5.5 Mbps，BER 由 0.001 到 0.004，时延由 25 到 35 ms；约束为 BER≤0.002、时延≤30 ms。仅按数值规则判断是否通过验证、是否建议回滚，并列出违例。","arguments":{"before":"{\"throughput\":5.0,\"ber\":0.001,\"latency_ms\":25}","after":"{\"throughput\":5.5,\"ber\":0.004,\"latency_ms\":35}","constraints":"{\"ber\":{\"max\":0.002},\"latency_ms\":{\"max\":30}}"},"answer_paths":["/accepted","/rollback_recommended","/constraint_violations"],"source_ref":"repo:tools/closed_loop_validator.schema.json","scenario_id":"curated_A21","origin_type":"expert_authored","reviewer":"PENDING_PRODUCT_REVIEW","review_status":"draft","expected":{"accepted":false,"score":-1.0999999999999999,"comparisons":{"ber":{"before":0.001,"after":0.004,"direction":"lower","improvement_fraction":-3.0,"result":"degraded"},"latency_ms":{"before":25.0,"after":35.0,"direction":"lower","improvement_fraction":-0.4,"result":"degraded"},"throughput":{"before":5.0,"after":5.5,"direction":"higher","improvement_fraction":0.1,"result":"improved"}},"constraint_violations":[{"metric":"ber","rule":"max","required":0.002,"actual":0.004},{"metric":"latency_ms","rule":"max","required":30.0,"actual":35.0}],"rollback_recommended":true}}
